# Normalise line endings on commit.
#
# Several files in this branch are committed with LF but sit on disk with CRLF,
# because Windows editors rewrite them on save. Without this file, simply
# opening CHANGELOG.md would make Git report it as modified and a commit would
# carry hundreds of lines of pure line-ending churn.
#
# text=auto eol=lf: store LF in the repository, leave the working copy alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary - never touch these.
*.png  binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.jks  binary
*.keystore binary
